He wasn’t able to exercise hard.\nHe couldn’t manage to exercise hard.\n\n习惯/状态型（表达缺乏习惯或毅力）\nHe didn’t make an effort to exercise.\nHe didn’t put in the effort to work out.\nHe never tried hard to exercise.\n\n机会/条件不足型（表达客观条件不允许）\nHe didn’t have the chance to exercise hard.\nHe didn’t get to exercise hard.\nHe had no opportunity to exercise hard.\n\n口语化表达\nHe just couldn’t push himself to work out.\nHe didn’t manage to stick with exercising.\nHe wasn’t up for exercising hard.
